{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"rensu-e2-wei016-060","title":"建安中太祖开募屯田于淮南，以仓慈为绥集都尉","accounts":[{"id":"rensu-a-64a09c9afcace3e328b9","label":"正文","text":"建安中太祖开募屯田于淮南，以仓慈为绥集都尉","evidence":["rensu-q-5c61acf0e7038a6233f7"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"开募屯田于淮南","evidence":["rensu-q-5c61acf0e7038a6233f7"]},{"person":"rensu-p0002","role":"任绥集都尉","evidence":["rensu-q-5c61acf0e7038a6233f7"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本篇独立行动，未继承范围不同的旧事件日期。","evidence":["rensu-q-5c61acf0e7038a6233f7"]},"ordering_evidence":"rensu-q-5c61acf0e7038a6233f7","related_events":[{"event":"wudi-e-o124c","type":"related","evidence":["rensu-q-5c61acf0e7038a6233f7","wudi-e-o124c-q"]}],"order":3461},{"id":"rensu-e-o136","title":"仓慈到郡抑挫权右、抚恤贫羸；旧大族田地有余而小民无立锥之土，慈皆随口割赋，稍稍使毕其本直","accounts":[{"id":"rensu-a-cb8b7b78d603af5bf07b","label":"正文","text":"仓慈到郡抑挫权右、抚恤贫羸；旧大族田地有余而小民无立锥之土，慈皆随口割赋，稍稍使毕其本直","evidence":["rensu-q-312dabd4207770ba85e1"]},{"id":"rensu-a-37d2c359aea90f9b6562","label":"正文","text":"先是属城狱讼众猥、县不能决多集治下；仓慈躬往省阅、料简轻重，自非殊死但鞭杖遣之，一岁决刑曾不满十人","evidence":["rensu-q-78fc2484f1da140dbc06"]},{"id":"rensu-a-77303edd808e17e5c121","label":"正文","text":"仓慈劳来西域诸胡：欲诣洛者为封过所，欲从郡还者官为平取、以府现物与共交市，使吏民护送道路；民夷翕然称其德惠","evidence":["rensu-q-92006e1b49a8da79668e"]}],"participants":[{"person":"rensu-p0002","role":"抑挫权右者；省阅决狱者；抚劳诸胡者","evidence":["rensu-q-312dabd4207770ba85e1","rensu-q-78fc2484f1da140dbc06","rensu-q-92006e1b49a8da79668e"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["rensu-q-312dabd4207770ba85e1","rensu-q-78fc2484f1da140dbc06","rensu-q-92006e1b49a8da79668e"]},"ordering_evidence":"rensu-q-312dabd4207770ba85e1","source_order":[16,351,59],"order":3462},{"id":"rensu-e-o138","title":"仓慈居数年卒官，吏民悲感如丧亲戚，图画其形思其遗像","accounts":[{"id":"rensu-a-6d03926f162554781fcc","label":"正文","text":"仓慈居数年卒官，吏民悲感如丧亲戚，图画其形思其遗像","evidence":["rensu-q-bc877cdd6e2ce96cf414"]},{"id":"rensu-a-db148b9bc8209ea95572","label":"正文","text":"西域诸胡闻仓慈死，会聚于戊己校尉及长吏治下发哀，或以刀画面以明血诚，又为立祠遥共祠之","evidence":["rensu-q-7660785f56cafb8e99c2"]}],"participants":[{"person":"rensu-p0002","role":"卒官者；受哀祭立祠者","evidence":["rensu-q-bc877cdd6e2ce96cf414","rensu-q-7660785f56cafb8e99c2"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["rensu-q-bc877cdd6e2ce96cf414","rensu-q-7660785f56cafb8e99c2"]},"ordering_evidence":"rensu-q-bc877cdd6e2ce96cf414","source_order":[16,353,0],"order":3463}],"persons":[{"id":"rensu-p0002","name":"仓慈","evidence":["rensu-q-5c61acf0e7038a6233f7","rensu-q-312dabd4207770ba85e1","rensu-q-78fc2484f1da140dbc06","rensu-q-92006e1b49a8da79668e","rensu-q-bc877cdd6e2ce96cf414","rensu-q-7660785f56cafb8e99c2","rensu-q-ed8966951edeacf4367a","rensu-q2-0a6f50ccd35405172d6a","rensu-q-e4601bb0dbb6d5b85de2","rensu-q2-791c08f8d328b3447c01","rensu-q-b58abc87e6a6d7180ea7"],"facts":[{"id":"rensu-f2-533a54e44b5dd78baff3","text":"黄初末为长安令。","evidence":["rensu-q-ed8966951edeacf4367a"]},{"id":"rensu-f2-326cafb7c434d23f8e0f","text":"太和中迁敦煌太守。","evidence":["rensu-q2-0a6f50ccd35405172d6a"]},{"id":"rensu-f2-b7b90612224d33fbd99c","text":"本传并记魏郡太守陈国吴瓘、清河太守乐安任燠、京兆太守济北颜斐、弘农太守太原令狐邵、济南相鲁国孔乂，咸为良二千石。","evidence":["rensu-q-e4601bb0dbb6d5b85de2"]},{"id":"rensu-f2-5d89858353522b6f726b","text":"《魏略》记王迁代慈，金城赵基继迁；嘉平中皇甫隆代基为敦煌太守。","evidence":["rensu-q2-791c08f8d328b3447c01"]},{"id":"rensu-f2-c277cc827e29b26b8c79","text":"《孔氏谱》记孔乂字元㑺，曾祖畴字元矩、为陈相；乂为散骑常侍、至大鸿胪；子恂字士信，为晋平东将军、卫尉。","evidence":["rensu-q-b58abc87e6a6d7180ea7"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"rensu-q-312dabd4207770ba85e1","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-a5527c4239142999ce0a","layer":"original","quote":"慈到，抑挫权右，抚恤贫羸，甚得其理。旧大族田地有余，而小民无立锥之土；慈皆随口割赋〖3〗，稍稍使毕其本直","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":350,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":59,"end":111},{"id":"rensu-q-5c61acf0e7038a6233f7","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-105bd2ac24503b20d821","layer":"original","quote":"建安中，太祖开募屯田于淮南，以慈为绥集都尉","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":348,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":16,"end":37},{"id":"rensu-q-7660785f56cafb8e99c2","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-09fb64b95e0fb196800d","layer":"original","quote":"及西域诸胡闻慈死，悉共会聚于戊己校尉及长吏治下，发哀〖13〗；或有以刀画面，以明血诚。又为立祠，遥共祠之","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":352,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":25,"end":77},{"id":"rensu-q-78fc2484f1da140dbc06","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-549bbe19cab83ae4c38e","layer":"original","quote":"先是，属城狱讼众猥〖5〗，县不能决，多集治下。慈躬往省阅，料简轻重；自非殊死〖6〗，但鞭杖遣之，一岁决刑曾不满十人","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":351,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":57},{"id":"rensu-q-92006e1b49a8da79668e","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-549bbe19cab83ae4c38e","layer":"original","quote":"慈皆劳之，欲诣洛者，为封过所〖11〗；欲从郡还者，官为平取〖12〗，辄以府现物与共交市，使吏民护送道路。由是民夷翕然，称其德惠","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":351,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":113,"end":176},{"id":"rensu-q-b58abc87e6a6d7180ea7","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-4950c60201dbc6155719","layer":"pei","quote":"按《孔氏谱》：孔乂字元㑺。孔子之后。曾祖畴，字元矩。陈相。汉桓帝立老子庙于苦县之赖乡，画孔子像于壁；畴为陈相，立孔子碑于像前，今见存。乂父、祖皆二千石。乂为散骑常侍，上疏规谏，语在《三少帝纪》。至大鸿胪。子恂，字士信。晋平东将军、卫尉也。","attribution":"裴注（引书见引句）","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":376,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-5a7a9e505ad84ef4841b","start":0,"end":119},{"id":"rensu-q-bc877cdd6e2ce96cf414","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-09fb64b95e0fb196800d","layer":"original","quote":"数年，卒官。吏民悲感如丧亲戚，图画其形，思其遗像","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":352,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":24},{"id":"rensu-q-e4601bb0dbb6d5b85de2","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-7c04d9e6bf316c95e295","layer":"original","quote":"自太祖迄于咸熙〖14〗，魏郡太守陈国吴瓘，清河太守乐安任燠，京兆太守济北颜斐，弘农太守太原令狐邵，济南相鲁国孔乂：或哀矜折狱〖15〗，或推诚惠爱，或治身清白，或擿奸发伏，〖16〗咸为良二千石。﹝二﹞","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":353,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":99},{"id":"rensu-q-ed8966951edeacf4367a","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-83f1a1f978a67922f322","layer":"original","quote":"黄初末，为长安令。清约有方，吏民畏而爱之。","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":349,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":21},{"id":"rensu-q2-0a6f50ccd35405172d6a","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-a5527c4239142999ce0a","layer":"original","quote":"太和中，迁敦煌太守。郡在西陲，以丧乱隔绝，旷无太守二十岁。大姓雄张〖2〗，遂以为俗。前太守尹奉等，循故而已，无所匡革。慈到，抑挫权右，抚恤贫羸，甚得其理。旧大族田地有余，而小民无立锥之土；慈皆随口割赋〖3〗，稍稍使毕其本直〖4〗。","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":350,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":115},{"id":"rensu-q2-791c08f8d328b3447c01","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-3e5b9b12d5342d616cd2","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《魏略》曰：“天水王迁，承代慈，虽循其迹，不能及也；金城赵基承迁后，复不如迁；至嘉平中，安定皇甫隆，代基为太守。初，敦煌不甚晓田，常灌溉蓄水，使极濡洽，然后乃耕；又不晓作耧犁、用水及种：人牛功力既费，而收谷更少。隆到，教作耧犁，又教衍溉。岁终率计：其所省庸力过半，得谷加五。又敦煌俗：妇人作裙，挛缩如羊肠，用布一匹；隆又禁改之，所省复不訾。故敦煌人以为：隆刚断严毅，不及于慈；至于勤恪爱惠，为下兴利，可以亚之。”","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":372,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-1dd7fbac51c831f1dce4","start":0,"end":209},{"id":"wudi-e-o124c-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-6668d55c18f139909c63","layer":"original","quote":"置扬州郡县长吏，开芍陂屯田〖11〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":16,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":130,"end":148}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
